      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T21:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggested text:\n\nThe matrix configures how much each axis of the physical sensor data contributes to the standard reference frame. In the standard reference frame, x-axis points to the right, y-axis points up, z-axis points towards the user.\n\nRows in the matrix specify the sensor axis data. Columns specify the standard reference frame axis.",
      "parentUuid": "6875da98_4b6411d2",
      "revId": "74cb0d03067e573650c8a55d31443694d4e52f91",
